WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.513
Let’s find your Google review link and add it to PrimeReviews.

00:00:03.513 --> 00:00:07.026
Use the link that opens the review form for your business.

00:00:07.833 --> 00:00:11.523
On a computer, go to business dot google dot com.

00:00:11.523 --> 00:00:17.427
Sign in with the Google account that manages your business, then select the correct business profile.

00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:20.847
Check the business name and location.

00:00:20.847 --> 00:00:23.876
In your Business Profile, select Read reviews.

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:26.796
Next, select Get more reviews.

00:00:26.796 --> 00:00:30.479
This opens the options for sharing your review link.

00:00:31.333 --> 00:00:33.526
Choose Copy beside the review link.

00:00:33.526 --> 00:00:35.719
Copy the full link Google provides.

00:00:35.719 --> 00:00:38.643
The address shown here is only an example.

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:40.786
Return to PrimeReviews.

00:00:40.786 --> 00:00:46.357
Paste the copied link into the Google review URL field, then select Continue.

00:00:47.167 --> 00:00:49.685
Open your copied link in another browser tab.

00:00:49.685 --> 00:00:53.147
Check that it leads to the review form for your business.

00:00:53.147 --> 00:00:56.295
Customers may need to sign in to Google to post.

00:00:57.167 --> 00:01:03.999
If the options are missing, check that you are signed in as an owner or manager of the correct profile.

00:01:03.999 --> 00:01:05.708
Google’s screen labels can vary.

00:01:05.708 --> 00:01:08.099
You are ready to continue with PrimeReviews.

